<h2>2. Merchant Processing &amp; Interchange-Plus Effective Rate Formula</h2>
<p>We compute 12-month payment processing cost by comparing flat-rate blended pricing against wholesale Interchange-Plus (<code>IC+</code>) and <code>0%</code>-markup subscription models:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Wholesale Interchange + Assessments Baseline:</strong> Blended <code>1.88% + $0.10</code> (online CNP) / <code>1.52% + $0.07</code> (card-present POS) + <code>0.14%</code> card-brand assessments, incorporating the Federal Reserve Regulation II (<code>.gov</code>) regulated debit cap of <code>0.05% + $0.22</code>.</li>
